---
layout: layouts/inner.njk
permalink: /about/
section: about
band: about
bandTip: "Small crew. We pick up the phone."
crewPerches: ".info, .steps li"
scripts: [band]
title: "About CuSS: custom software from Athlone | CuSS"
description: "CuSS Custom Software Solutions is a small software business in Athlone, Co. Westmeath, building automation, apps, dashboards and websites for Irish businesses."
crumbs:
  - { name: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { name: "About" }
---
{#- About (design spec section 1, brief): the business, not a person. No founder photo or name.
    The trust points and steps reuse the home page's agreed draft copy (index.11tydata.js). PLACEHOLDER: the page's own copy. -#}
{%- from "macros.njk" import steps, contact, ph with context %}
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="intro">
    <p class="mono eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>About CuSS</h1>
    {{ ph('a short lead: who CuSS is, from Athlone, for Irish businesses (the business, not a person)') }}
  </div>
  <section class="sec-tight" aria-labelledby="story-h">
    <h2 id="story-h">Who we are</h2>
    {{ ph('two or three paragraphs about the business: what we do, how we work, the partner team for bigger data work') }}
  </section>
  <section class="sec-tight" aria-labelledby="why-h" data-crew-tip="Small crew. We pick up the phone.">
    <h2 id="why-h">Why CuSS</h2>
    <ul class="grid g4 plain">
      {%- for w in why %}
      <li class="info bv-lg">{% icon w.icon, "ci" %}<h3 class="h4">{{ w.t }}</h3><p>{{ w.d }}</p></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="sec-tight" aria-labelledby="how-h">
    <h2 id="how-h">How we work</h2>
    {{ steps(howSteps) }}
  </section>
  <section class="contact-sec sec-tight" aria-labelledby="contact-h">
    {{ contact('Tell us what you need') }}
  </section>
</div>
